  "fluff": {
    "overview": "<p>The Free Worlds League Military has long fielded some of the largest infantry formations in the Inner Sphere, with regiments numbering nearly 1,800 soldiers compared to roughly 750 in the Combine and just over 1,000 in the Federated Suns. Towing crew-served Ultra autocannon/20, these platoons wield the most devastating rapid-fire direct weapon available to conventional infantry. Double-firing an AC/20-class weapon produces tremendous destruction at short range, though the strain on the mechanism makes jamming a serious concern.</p>"
